  "open_questions": [
    "Density holds 'LBS PER U.S. GAL @ 15.6 C 8.33' (Target), with 'LBS PER IMP GAL @ 15.6 C 10' as an alternate entry; 'SPECIFIC GRAVITY @ 15.6 C 0.979 0.999 1.019' is recorded in the optional specific_gravity property (2026-10-24).",
    "Physical values are in the 'Target' column (target, not typical); chemical values in the 'Typical' column. KV40/flash/pour usually have no min/max.",
    "Package TBN is printed only where the table has a 'BASE NUMBER (MGKOH/G)' row; otherwise left Missing.",
    "Zinc is on page 2, which is image-only (DL2-10633.pdf p.2); read visually: 1.11 / 1.23 / 1.35.",
    "[History] User decision 2026-10-17: the density field stored 0.999 (specific gravity, dimensionless) from 'SPECIFIC GRAVITY @ 15.6 C 0.979 0.999 1.019' (DL2-10633.pdf p.1). Superseded 2026-10-24 by the approved optional specific_gravity property: the specific gravity moved there and density now holds the printed 8.33 lbs/US gal @ 15.6 C."
